  "id": "clinical-neuropsychology",
  "term": "clinical neuropsychology",
  "definition": "Clinical neuropsychology is an applied neuroscience field that uses both neurobiological information and real-world behavioral data in clinical work. It increasingly frames mental and neurocognitive conditions in more dimensional, individualized ways and links neuropsychological knowledge with clinical practice.",
